    "visible_text": "Motorcycles Offers Finance Dealers FAQ About Contact Test Ride Book Now APEX MOTO — Est. 2014 Born to Ride. Built to Last. Precision-engineered motorcycles forged for those who demand more from every road. Power. Style. Character. This is the Apex difference. Explore Motorcycles → Book a Test Ride Find a Dealer 50,000+ Riders Worldwide 18 Iconic Models 120+ Dealers Across India 10 Yrs Engineering Excellence Our Machines Featured Motorcycles From pure urban aggression to trans-continental capability. Handpicked from our line-up. Bestseller Adventure Thunderstrike 650 Command the Horizon 648cc Engine 47 bhp Power ₹4,20,000 Starting* Explore Test Ride New Launch Classic Phantom 350 Classic Soul. Modern Heart. 349cc Engine 21 bhp Power ₹2,15,000 Starting* Explore Test Ride Popular Street Storm 200 City. Conquered. 199cc Engine 25 bhp Power ₹1,45,000 Starting* Explore Test Ride Off-Road Ready Scrambler Zenith 450 Scrambler Paved Roads Optional. 449cc Engine 38 bhp Power ₹3,35,000 Starting* Explore Test Ride New Launch Adventure Thunderstrike 450 Adventure, Unlocked. 452cc Engine 40 bhp Power ₹2,89,000 Starting* Explore Test Ride Limited Edition Adventure Thunderstrike 650 Rally Built for the Dakar in You. 648cc Engine 47 bhp Power ₹5,29,000 Starting* Explore Test Ride View All 18 Models → The Apex Standard Built Without Compromise Four cornerstones that define every motorcycle that leaves our facility. Engineering First Every component is precision-engineered for performance, reliability, and longevity. Designed to Inspire Timeless aesthetics that turn every ride into a statement. Built to be noticed. Built to Last Rigorous quality testing across 50+ parameters ensures your Apex Moto goes the distance. Rider Community Join 50,000+ Apex Moto riders in a global community of passion, adventure, and brotherhood. Feel The Ride Ready to Experience Apex Moto? Book a free, zero-obligation test ride at your nearest dealership today. Helmet and safety gear pro